Do ivoConsumer.$consume(1,ivnTimeout*1000,lvLstRegs) Returns lvbOk
If lvbOk
	If lvLstRegs.$linecount>0
		Calculate lvLstRegs.$line as 1
		Do ivLstMessagesOcc.$add()
		Calculate ivLstMessagesOcc.$line as ivLstMessagesOcc.$linecount
		Calculate ivLstMessagesOcc.Offset as lvLstRegs.Offset
		Calculate ivLstMessagesOcc.Partition as lvLstRegs.Partition
		Calculate ivLstMessagesOcc.Topic as lvLstRegs.Topic
		Calculate ivLstMessagesOcc.Key as lvLstRegs.Key
		Calculate ivLstMessagesOcc.Timestamp as lvLstRegs.Timestamp
		Calculate ivLstMessagesOcc.Message as lvLstRegs.Message
		
		Do lvLstHeaders.$clear()
		Do method FillLstHeaders (lvLstHeaders)
		Calculate ivLstMessagesOcc.Headers as lvLstHeaders
	Else
		Do $cwind.$showmessage("No messages!")
	End If
Else
	Do $cwind.$showmessage(ivoConsumer.$geterrormessage(),"Error")
End If

Redraw (Refresh now) cgMessagesOcc
Quit method